      "writtenOn": "2012-09-10T21:25:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How frequently is this branch taken? I am worried that this might behave in unexpected ways under different loads, depending on how fast the battery is discharging.\n\nFor example, if we are discharging and we reach 2% charge, then the moving average may look like { 4, 3, 3, 2 }, which produces an average of 3, so this will not be taken.\n\nAlso, what if the AP is off (we are not in ST_DISCHARGING) and power leaks for multiple days? Can you end up with a large moving average that will break this algorithm, such as { 10, 9, 8, 2 } ?",
